{{!-- home/feature-card.hbs — one reason, as the design system's `.ns-feature`.

     The system's anatomy is __top (the glyph and the INDEX) then __name then
     __text. The index is the part the theme's own version was missing, and it
     is the point of the component: six unnumbered cards read as a wall, and
     six numbered ones read as a list you can hold in your head.

     The parent is `.ns-features`, which is the auto-fitting grid — not a
     generic `.ns-grid--3`, so the count reflows on its own terms.

     Params: icon (a name from partials/icons.hbs) · index · title · body --}}
<article class="ns-feature js-spotlight">
  <div class="ns-feature__top">
    {{> icons name=icon}}
    {{#if index}}<span class="ns-feature__num">{{index}}</span>{{/if}}
  </div>
  <h3 class="ns-feature__name">{{title}}</h3>
  <p class="ns-feature__text">{{body}}</p>
</article>
